---
description: Commit and push to origin after every change
alwaysApply: true
---

# Always push

When you finish a change the user can see on the site or in the repo:

1. Create a git commit (do not wait for "commit" or "puja").
2. Push to `origin` on the current branch (`git push origin HEAD`).
3. Tell the user the commit and that Pages will update.

Do not force-push. Do not skip hooks. Do not change git config.
